  "rule": "Build data/processed/eval_canonical_v2/ : the 6 canonical eval datasets with\nTRAIN-contaminated queries removed.\n\nRule E (external-holdout disjointness), applied to the 5 EXTERNAL datasets only\n(`test` is in-distribution by design and is copied through unchanged):\n\n    exclude external query q  iff  EXISTS train pair t with\n        norm(q.query_text_raw) == norm(t.query_text_raw)\n        AND publicid(q.cde_publicid) == publicid(t.cde_publicid)\n      OR q.query_id in train.query_id\n\n    norm(x) = collapse_ws(re.sub(r'[^a-z0-9]+', ' ', lower(x)))\n    publicid(x) = x.split('::')[0]\n\nWhole-query removal (all rows of an excluded query_id go), matching the convention in\nscripts/build_reachable_eval_splits.py. NEVER overwrites data/processed/eval_canonical/.\n",
